<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-UBS named global focus stock.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-UBS named global focus stock.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it named Union Bank of Switzerland a global focus stock.</p>
<p>-- said it rated the stock a near-term buy, long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>	 (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
